    "naming_convention_prompt": "## Lab Naming Convention\n\nThis laboratory uses non-standard population names. You MUST use these exact names in your hierarchy:\n\n- **Zanthrex Population**: defined by `CD45+ (SSC-A vs CD45)`\n- **Grindlax Cells**: defined by `SSC-A vs FSC-A`\n- **Blixtar Subset**: defined by `FSC-A vs FSC-H`\n- **Krondule Cells**: defined by `CD34- (SSC-A vs CD34)`\n- **Splonix Subset**: defined by `SSC-hi CD14- (SSC-A vs CD14)`\n- **Snorfalax Population**: defined by `CD15+ (SSC-A vs CD15)`\n- **Qwelnar Cells**: defined by `CD193- (CD16 vs CD193)`\n- **Zorphan Population**: defined by `CD193+ (CD16 vs CD193)`\n- **Threxix Population**: defined by `SSC-int CD14+ AND SSC-lo CD14- (SSC-A vs CD14)`\n- **Morglian Cells**: defined by `CD3+ (CD14 vs CD3)`\n- **Blemfark Cells**: defined by `CD3- CD14-`\n- **Plixnor Cells**: defined by `CD34+ CD193- (CD34 vs CD193)`\n- **Flonkian Subset**: defined by `CD34- CD193+ (CD34 vs CD193)`\n- **Quixar Subset**: defined by `CD34- CD193-`\n- **Grimblex Cells**: defined by `CD14- HLA-DR- (HLA-DR vs CD14)`\n- **Frimblax Population**: defined by `CD56+ and/or CD16+ (CD56 vs CD16, exclude CD16- CD56-)`\n- **Vexilon Population**: defined by `CD14+ and/or CD16+ (CD16 vs CD14)`\n- **Wumbus Cells**: defined by `CD14+ CD16-`\n- **Prexilox Subset**: defined by `CD14+ CD16+`\n- **Flurbigan Cells**: defined by `CD14- CD16+`\n- **Vondrak Cells**: defined by `CD14- CD16-`\n- **Zymbrix Subset**: defined by `CD19+ (CD19 vs CD38)`\n- **Nimbular Cells**: defined by `CD38++ CD1c- (CD1c vs CD38)`\n- **Glorp Cells**: defined by `CD1c+ CD38lo (CD1c vs CD38)`\n\nUse standard names (Singlets, Lymphocytes, Live) for QC gates only.\n",
